{"channelId":"UCh_M5SjC1BLnGKv_O-UtK0w","row":["Connecticut's Kid Governor®",836,"Connecticut’s Kid Governor® empowers 5th graders to change the world. This ground-breaking approach to civics education immerses students in a real election for their state’s Kid Governor, a fellow 5th grader who will represent them during a one-year term of active leadership. More than a contest and not just about the position of governor, the program teaches important lessons about state government, voting, elections, and civic participation.\n\nSubscribe to the Connecticut's Kid Governor® YouTube channel or follow the program on Facebook, Instagram, and Twitter (@CTKidGovernor) for the latest updates. Learn more at CT.KidGovernor.org.\n\nConnecticut's Kid Governor® is an award-winning civics program for 5th graders created by The Connecticut Democracy Center at Connecticut's Old State House.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCh_M5SjC1BLnGKv_O-UtK0w","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCh_M5SjC1BLnGKv_O-UtK0w","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:57.689Z","channelId":"UCh_M5SjC1BLnGKv_O-UtK0w","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"d90bc6f81af012de30ebc4848c2886a634b36032b3fe0f1e14e30f72021ee513","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"7af213a120914ad4ecb32e3c449c8361398151916d6c49d4622a8bf052f921c4"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCh_M5SjC1BLnGKv_O-UtK0w","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":836,"raw":"836 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCh_M5SjC1BLnGKv_O-UtK0w","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:57.689Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":[]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review","reason":"简介上下